                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bfdcc77-0aca-42e3-994b-fbab7f2868c7",
                                                "sense_id": "189076d0-e2f0-3f43-a49b-b147b7dd9a65",
                                                "text": "“Sixteen years ago, fresh out of college, a 22 year old intern in the White House – and more than averagely romantic – I fell in love with my boss in a 22-year old sort of way. It happens,” Lewinsky said."
